.2025","MPWR.inventory.2022","MPWR.cost.2022"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was China: $1.5 billion, 55% of revenue.","cites":["MPWR.mix.geography.2025.0","MPWR.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Distributor A” at 26% of revenue.","cites":["MPWR.conc.2025.0"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Distributor B” at 18% of revenue.","cites":["MPWR.conc.2025.1"]},{"topic":"customers","text":"The FY2025 report tags the customer it labels “Distributor C” at 10% of revenue.","cites":["MPWR.conc.2025.2"]}]}}